    "text": "Isn’t it weird? Bondi did the same thing. Said she was releasing the Epstein files but just punked the whole world while feigning ignorance of what was meant by “Epstein files”. It’s like “oh, I thought you meant you wanted me to collate what we knew already and get that out in one file folder.” Like she didn’t know that there were tens of thousands of other files and stuff. She must really be stupid to think that anyone would buy that whole routine. I’m starting to think the files indict Trump. What other answer could there be?",
